      "name": "System status",
      "group": "Status",
      "area": "holding",
      "address": "0x2AB4",
      "type": "uint16",
      "access": "R",
      "description": "0 = system OK. Bit 0 operation mode (0 auto, 1 manual); bit 1 stand-by (0 running, 1 stop); bit 2 installation (0 completed, 1 not yet); bit 3 test (1 in progress); bit 4 faults (1 some general faults); bit 5 inhibiting signal (1 activated); bit 6 cooling mode (1 activated); bits 7-15 reserved."
    },
